      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنِيقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> [<i>sack such as is called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِرَارَة</span> [q. v.]:
(AA, O, K:) or <i>a small</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غرارة</span>: or a receptacle
smaller than the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غرارة</span>: (TA:) [said by Meyd to
be <i>a sack in which clay,</i> or <i>mud, is carried away:</i>
